        "instruction": "Go to the 'Pictures' folder, check the file sizes of 'Wallpaper1.png' through 'Wallpaper5.png'. Clear any existing content in 'text.txt' inside the Documents folder, write down their sizes in the format 'Wallpaper[n]: [number] bytes' on separate lines, and save the file. Keep the file open.",
